"The adjustable flashlight spell is an auriad hand-casting spell."
"It relies on the memory of light in the place where it is cast."
"It is presumably easier outdoors and in rooms that are usually bright."
"Its diagrams wrap the hands in string, looped around the pinkie tips."
"The caster calls the memory of light toward a lantern symbol, holding command of its center."
"Overpowered, it can give a blinding flash that stings skin and briefly impairs vision."
